  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Change Forestry Project in Sikasso Region, Phas II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal is to increase the resilience of the population in the Sikasso Region to the impact of climate change by contributing to sustainable forest management and increased income from non-timber forest products</narrative>
  </description>
